== Thread States ==
New -> Runnable <--> Running ->
Waiting/Blocked
Waiting Blocked -> Runnable
Running -> Dead

= Meanings =
Runnable = ready to run
Running = running (doing what he was desired to do)
Waiting/Blocked = waiting for the next command / blocked by a command (sleeping)
Dead = dead thread (impossible to do anything)

